<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgba(247,248,250,1)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="8" width="650" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>02 / FROZEN PROTOCOL</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="716" topLeftY="8" width="196" height="14"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="right" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>A8 / RK31 / APPLICABILITY</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="27" width="864" height="35"><content textType="body" fontSize="23" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31,41,55,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>The primary endpoint is observed effect, not the 10-seed mean</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="72" width="58" height="3" presetHandlers="1"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(37,99,235,1)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="82" width="864" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.2" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>One 24-endpoint Holm family · no hyperparameter search · no outcome leakage across contexts</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="104" width="204" height="78" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="113" width="176" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>EVALUATION</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="129" width="176" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="21" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>10 × 5</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="160" width="176" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>seeds × whole-cluster folds</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="268" topLeftY="104" width="204" height="78" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="282" topLeftY="113" width="176" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>UNCERTAINTY</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="282" topLeftY="129" width="176" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="21" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(13,148,136,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>10,000</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="282" topLeftY="160" width="176" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>whole-cluster bootstraps</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="488" topLeftY="104" width="204" height="78" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="502" topLeftY="113" width="176" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>NULL TEST</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="502" topLeftY="129" width="176" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="21" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>10,000</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="502" topLeftY="160" width="176" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>cluster sign-swap permutations</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="708" topLeftY="104" width="204" height="78" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="722" topLeftY="113" width="176" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>PRIMARY FAMILY</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="722" topLeftY="129" width="176" height="30"><content textType="body" fontSize="21" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(13,148,136,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>24</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="722" topLeftY="160" width="176" height="17"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>3 contexts × 4 baselines × 2 metrics</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="202" width="424" height="120" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="211" width="396" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(225,29,72,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>Every primary PASS requires all four</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="233" width="396" height="81"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31,41,55,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>1. Primary-seed observed effect &gt; 0</p><p>2. 95% CI lower bound &gt; 0</p><p>3. Holm-adjusted p &lt; 0.05 across 24 endpoints</p><p>4. At least 8/10 seed effects positive</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="488" topLeftY="202" width="424" height="120" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(255,255,255,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="502" topLeftY="211" width="396" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>Feature and fit discipline</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="502" topLeftY="233" width="396" height="81"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31,41,55,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>Full adds full-300-nt, minimum-window and mean-window MFE</p><p>Gating adds six context × MFE interactions</p><p>Fold-local scaling · Ridge alpha = 1.0 · no tuning</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="338" width="864" height="122" presetHandlers="8"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(204,251,241,1)"/></fill><border color="rgba(226,232,240,1)" width="1"/></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="347" width="836" height="18"><content textType="body" fontSize="10.5" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(13,148,136,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>Observed effect and seed stability are different quantities</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="369" width="836" height="83"><content textType="body" fontSize="11" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31,41,55,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" wrap="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>Tables report the frozen primary-seed observed effect and its whole-cluster inference.</p><p>The seed column is a stability count, not a substitute for observed effect or family-wide significance.</p><p>Broad applicability requires all 24 endpoints; gating-over-shared-full also requires its six dedicated comparisons.</p></content></shape><shape type="round-rect" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="474" width="864" height="30" presetHandlers="6"><fill><fillColor color="rgba(204,251,241,1)"/></fill></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="62" topLeftY="478" width="836" height="21"><content textType="body" fontSize="9.8" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(13,148,136,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>FROZEN PASS RULE · EFFECT + CI + HOLM P + SEED STABILITY</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="512" width="780" height="13"><content textType="body" fontSize="8.2" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(100,116,139,1)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15"><p>Source: result 77634740a592 · closeout b401cee135d4 · independent 177/177 · clean 77/77</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="850" topLeftY="510" width="62" height="15"><content textType="body" fontSize="10" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(31,41,55,1)" textAlign="right" verticalAlign="middle" wrap="false" lineSpacing="multiple:1.15" bold="true"><p>132</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>The observed effect comes from the frozen primary seed.</p><p>The ten-seed mean is not substituted for that effect in the primary tables.</p><p>Every endpoint must pass four criteria, including family-wide Holm significance.</p><p>Broad applicability requires all twenty-four endpoints to pass.</p></content></note></slide>
